description: Use when answering People Analytics questions (headcount, hires, terminations, attrition, tenure).
alwaysApply: false
---

# Semantic layer first

- Take People Analytics metrics from the semantic layer. Never recompute them from raw tables.
- If a metric is not in the layer, say so and stop before writing your own definition.
- Always state the as-of date of the number you report.
